Changes: added the windowed-sinc design recipe with ripple/transition-width measurements, a full explanation of SLR (Cayley–Klein parameters, hard-pulse approximation, FIR-filter view, inverse transform) with a Python port of `dzrf`/`abr` validated against the stored pulses and the Bloch simulator, excitation/inversion/refocusing comparisons, adiabatic hyperbolic-secant pulses with a $B_1$-robustness test, and multi-band pulses; ported all code to SI-unit Python; noted the stored pulses' units (mT on a 0.1 ms raster).*
